  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A long-wearing brow pencil with pencil-sharp precision, perfect for filling in sparse brows. <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens and phthalates. It is also cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This formula’s gel base glides on and sets for a water-resistant, long-wearing finish. The slim, oval shape allows for dimensional, hair-like strokes, while the treated pigments stay true to color all day.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Polyethylene, Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Copernicia Cerifera Cera/Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Hydrogenated Coco-Glycerides, Zinc Stearate, Mica, Caprylic/Capric Glycerides, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Polybutene, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sorbitan Tristearate. May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-) : CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491/CI 77492/CI 77499 (Iron Oxides).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A long-wearing brow pencil with pencil-sharp precision, perfect for filling in sparse brows. <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens and phthalates. It is also cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This formula’s gel base glides on and sets for a water-resistant, long-wearing finish. The slim, oval shape allows for dimensional, hair-like strokes, while the treated pigments stay true to color all day.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Polyethylene, Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Copernicia Cerifera Cera/Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Hydrogenated Coco-Glycerides, Zinc Stearate, Mica, Caprylic/Capric Glycerides, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Polybutene, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sorbitan Tristearate. May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-) : CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491/CI 77492/CI 77499 (Iron Oxides).</div></details>",
